  "name": "Student Registration",
  "description": "Enroll a new student: student details, grade, guardian contacts, health and learning support, services and required documents.",
  "category": "Education",
  "seoTitle": "Free Student Registration Form Template",
  "seoDescription": "Student registration form template that collects student details, grade, parent or guardian contacts, health notes, IEP or 504 status and document uploads.",
